mainmenu "DigitalStethoscope"

config PHYSICALINTERFACE_VOLUME_POTENTIOMETER_FITTED
	bool "Volume potentiometer J7 fitted"
	depends on ADC
	help
	  Read the volume potentiometer on GPIO1, ADC1 channel 0. Without it,
	  L1_PHYSICALINTERFACE does not read the ADC and reports the volume as
	  absent, because an unfitted wiper floats and its readings mean nothing.
	  J7 is not fitted on the first evaluation carrier (decision of
	  10 November 2026).

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
